OL,3,AOptimus Prime and Eeyore voice actor
OL,4,APeter Cullen dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Peter Cullen, who voiced popular
OL,7,Fcharacters including Optimus Prime in
OL,8,FTransformers and Eeyore in Disney's
OL,9,FWinnie the Pooh franchise, has died at
OL,10,Fthe age of 85.
OL,12,FThe Canadian actor began his most
OL,13,Ffamous role - as the heroic deep-voiced
OL,14,FOptimus Prime - for the Transformers TV
OL,15,Fseries in 1984, then returned for seven
OL,16,FHollywood films from 2007 to 2023 and
OL,17,Fother spin-offs.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
