OL,3,AOptimus Prime and Eeyore voice actor
OL,4,APeter Cullen dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe voiced depressive donkey Eeyore in
OL,7,FTV animation The New Adventures of
OL,8,FWinnie the Pooh from the late 1980s as
OL,9,Fwell as numerous related shows, films
OL,10,Fand games.
OL,12,FHis other memorable voice parts
OL,13,Fincluded KARR, the evil counterpart to
OL,14,FKITT in TV show Knight Rider; the
OL,15,Fclicking vocalisations of The Predator
OL,16,Fin Arnold Schwarzenegger's 1987 film;
OL,17,Fand the roars of King Kong in 1976.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
